  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/sayment/223711571467\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://m.blog.naver.com/sayment/223711571467</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"#에듀테크 #이지메이커 #자극에대한반응실험 #반응시간 #데이터과학 #시각 #청각\" data-og-description=\"교과서 있는 자극에 대한 반응 실험하기 탐구 이 탐구는 얻는 데이터가 반응시간이 아니라 자의 낙하'...\" data-og-host=\"blog.naver.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/sayment/223711571467\" data-og-url=\"https://blog.naver.com/sayment/223711571467\" data-og-image=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/AFwvh/dJMb9b3P7vD/S5ZIK8KXiQyGnc1QdawRM1/kakaolink40_original.png?width=743&amp;height=447\"><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/sayment/223711571467\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/sayment/223711571467\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/AFwvh/dJMb9b3P7vD/S5ZIK8KXiQyGnc1QdawRM1/kakaolink40_original.png?width=743&amp;height=447\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">#에듀테크 #이지메이커 #자극에대한반응실험 #반응시간 #데이터과학 #시각 #청각</p><p class=\"og-desc\">교과서 있는 자극에 대한 반응 실험하기 탐구 이 탐구는 얻는 데이터가 반응시간이 아니라 자의 낙하'...</p><p class=\"og-host\">blog.naver.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">이번에는 제가 승윤쌤께 아이디어를 받아서<br>제작한 실험 가이드북입니다!<br><br>내용이 정말로 참신합니다.<br><br>시각 자극과 청각 자극을 실험자가 받고나서<br>클립을 붙히는데,<br>시청각 자극 자체도 센서로<br>자극 인식도 센서로 해서<br>그 시간 차이로 <br>자극에 대한 반응 시간을 측정하는<br>실험이었습니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1215dc7bce6147b21f70fa09758a24edfb6691fc\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1215dc7bce6147b21f70fa09758a24edfb6691fc\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1491\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/806b89d6e27d545abfc4027a9b47bd9ffbff55ac\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/806b89d6e27d545abfc4027a9b47bd9ffbff55ac\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1498\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6fd8d70c05410b3ef705d95bf1f4411ebb096e05\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6fd8d70c05410b3ef705d95bf1f4411ebb096e05\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1508\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4d7012994943131893da6ca55ce29c8ff89ae2e5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4d7012994943131893da6ca55ce29c8ff89ae2e5\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"983\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">여기부터 청각 반응 실험!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/00f6c7e6b8eaa09100ce1055c1ab4702708475a9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/00f6c7e6b8eaa09100ce1055c1ab4702708475a9\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1466\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9437fa7e323a824e5a12559287c05a71958fac98\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumc